{# Per-order detail table, used by all four US weekly emails (SAC
   halal_filtered, SAC halal, US Alpha-HRP, US Double HRP).

   India never sets ``order_results`` so this partial is rendered
   inside an ``{% if order_results and order_results.orders %}`` guard
   in every includer -- there is no ``{% if market == 'us' %}``
   branching anywhere; presence of the order list is the contract.

   The stop-loss column shows whatever ``stop_loss_reason`` says:

   * ``atr14``           -> the computed price + distance %
   * ``atr_unavailable`` -> the literal text "n/a (no ATR)" -- per
     AGENTS.md rule #1 we never substitute a flat percent here.
   * ``sell_no_stop``    -> em-dash, because exits don't carry stops.

   Trade value is rendered to two decimals; qty to four (matches the
   fractional-share precision from ``core/orders.py``). #}
<div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
  <h3 style="color: #374151; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 8px;">Order Execution Detail</h3>
  <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0;">
    Stop-loss is a display-only reference computed via ATR(14) &times; 2 with 5% floor / 10% cap. Sells do not carry a stop.
  </p>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 12px;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="background-color: #eff6ff;">
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Symbol</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Side</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Qty</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Price</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Trade Value</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: right; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Stop Loss</th>
        <th style="padding: 8px 6px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;">Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for o in order_results.orders %}
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-weight: bold;">{{ o.symbol }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: {{ '#16a34a' if o.side == 'buy' else '#dc2626' }}; font-weight: bold;">{{ o.side | upper }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: right;">{{ "%.4f" | format(o.qty) }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: right;">${{ "%.2f" | format(o.current_price) }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: right;">${{ "%.2f" | format(o.trade_value) }}</td>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; text-align: right;">
          {% if o.stop_loss_reason == 'atr14' and o.stop_loss_price is not none %}
            ${{ "%.2f" | format(o.stop_loss_price) }}
            <span style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 11px;">(-{{ "%.1f" | format(o.stop_loss_distance_pct * 100) }}%)</span>
          {% elif o.stop_loss_reason == 'sell_no_stop' %}
            <span style="color: #9ca3af;">&mdash;</span>
          {% else %}
            <span style="color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic;">n/a (no ATR)</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
        <td style="padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
          {% if o.submission_status == 'submitted' %}
            <span style="color: #16a34a;">submitted</span>
          {% elif o.submission_status == 'failed' %}
            <span style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold;">failed</span>
          {% elif o.submission_status == 'deduped' %}
            <span style="color: #6b7280;">deduped</span>
          {% else %}
            <span style="color: #6b7280;">{{ o.submission_status }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
